{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16972","headline":"酬谈校书长安秋夜对月寄诸故旧 · 武元衡","name":"酬谈校书长安秋夜对月寄诸故旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故园千里渺遐情，黄叶萧条白露生。\n惊鹊遶枝风满幌，寒钟送晓月当楹。\n蓬山高价传新韵，槐市芳年挹盛名。\n莫怪孔融悲岁序，五侯门馆重娄卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}